                    <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-sky-600 text-white flex items-center justify-center font-tech text-sm font-black flex-shrink-0 shadow-sm">B</span>
                    <span id="playerOptText1" class="flex-1 break-words leading-tight">Phương án B</span>
